## 3. How it's built

### The pieces

```
            Players' browsers / phones (installable web app)
                              │
                              ▼
   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │  Kohler server (Node.js + Express, one program)            │
   │                                                            │
   │  Accounts & sessions     Wallet & ledger    Survivor       │
   │  Casino host  ◄──────►  Kohler Studio (our game provider)  │
   │  Vault, avatars, Legends   Promos & referrals              │
   │  Payouts autopilot         Kohler Control (admin)          │
   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
         │                │                  │              │
         ▼                ▼                  ▼              ▼
   Neon Postgres     mempool.space      Cloudflare AI    Resend
   (all data)        (Bitcoin network)  + Pollinations   (email)
                                        (avatar pictures)
```

- **Hosting:** Vercel (serverless). It also runs on any ordinary server.
- **Database:** Neon Postgres. Every balance, bet, seat, purchase and setting lives here.
- **Bitcoin:** Kohler holds a 24-word recovery phrase (`DEPOSIT_MNEMONIC`). From it, every player
  gets their own deposit address, and payouts come from a separate "hot wallet" address.
  Kohler watches the blockchain through mempool.space, a public Bitcoin explorer.
- **Pictures:** avatars are painted by AI image models on Cloudflare Workers AI. Pollinations
  is a free backup painter.
- **Email:** Resend sends deposit, withdrawal and support emails.
- **Scheduled jobs:** on Vercel, a cron calls `/api/cron/tick` to check deposits, retry wins
  and do housekeeping.

